{"id":"34331535","title":"你敢信，这是广州的秋天！｜今日霜降","published_at":"2026-10-23T08:01:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-10-23","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBMsJ6yibRw5romIltNJ97nibLhuDrt2f0dVBeylF0NWIGiby9c2wv2Lkoiciaic9OmH7OCHODsOZ8eJXIqBibEk2BGs8xqCauYib5Ty8c/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"华农二十四节气 【编者按】霜降，是秋日节气的尾声。北方寒霜初降、木叶飘零，但岭南的秋色才缓缓登台。昼暖夜凉，不见白霜，却见繁花盛放。这其中，既有美丽异木棉、三角","tags":["校园"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AtR6E23PAWeSH_ti8LRDoQ","paper_url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34331535","word_count":1653,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T00:22:02+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4480476665726320640#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBicXEo2KZv7VdfpXK4h705Vl4lfTfFdvaDazKJzfvwlzjkwRILswxNsibHP6QgL3J8iaPtCpqqVtkp0sicqyo29TUYvdGIiaNDBGco/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0Fr0lUzicdOxfepxtcPXV3REoQbcek9mz23QvnibmsfV2dzGnr5nI0MfAib6aAOpF0ehg9b7TgWibI8OA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>华农二十四节气</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>【编者按】</span><span>霜降，是秋日节气的尾声。北方寒霜初降、木叶飘零，但岭南的秋色才缓缓登台。昼暖夜凉，不见白霜，却见繁花盛放</span><span>。这其中，既有美丽异木棉、三角梅等应季花种，也有樱花、玉兰等因气温条件巧合而绽放的春季花种。一时之间，校园里花开各处，构成了一片奇妙的南国秋景。</span></span></p><p><span>今天，走进《华农二十四节气》专题第十八站，在盛放草木间读懂属于南粤的秋收、秋养与秋景。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/froaryibZeTAUD1Pib7hkIAUuFu9ibnJmKkiblKuFz6yARWIOSMiaN5cbbZibicgtHfT19ic3IrN1wYFiaib3SlnqbSq5Gy0hR0lpiaR8VWQKQzpiaEzPicM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/xlUa6yzzFSicKemXT3nV8qCbFib3uWuX0hqyFEt832RwwmHicamiazmfkFjl5oJ3KT9hcDIDpd0khx70dBURFbRx3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nwZnKh8aNTenD4btKbrMjiaNscOqgHFicrSWCicSTMJGjLx9eqRQqFrM08R8TXBgpM4dRlDicqyGrKEX6aMSRg65SQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/froaryibZeTCDzy8qP6UzH6iaicjibzDqDYwKpia9PibHZuEQj5dvGDjH6seGOI01qRYUXRK8Km7soe9xJa25dlz4vKFL7WLBFRIK0aCz5eZZ4MSs/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>点击视频，走进华农霜降</span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBhJtDnwNxxTbZicVvIwKabR3niby5ZlMrK7Esh8XlP0jXNXNWxMQ7LX8EI960GFadBKlnxN3JZxiaTUJfiaEGcpD6MY5EGxvITTPg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBHBf4B3VRgzUBGiafz5uQboFzAWXOd1JEUURBH8O32gSaDVNTHfvAQicEC9xhUrDISgQOuAwriax3FKxrPeXDfXCa92OpM6iadiaI0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckD3M8w71ZVFfy02Yibw7ic4g4wkJtIaibm82lO2H3lDnTWel23w9vUIKnzF5xbRIAvwkuS4OtZvWvQqPKa7iaIgIQ4XLXklGzT2HDc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0ENyNdicZelDnuZ7TqfibeiaicvALw2ibv1ic2vFERBkulibZefpB1r6scUxamyJ59ggUTNP6IbMcolac50A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>昼暖夜生凉，繁花满芳园</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0ENyNdicZelDnuZ7TqfibeiaicvZh2BnIdJJDTmibsqCv6UvzxrFriaNDPe12OKcicup2XGicVK3kucOricx4A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>“气肃而凝，露结为霜。” 霜降之名，于岭南而言，不等同于寒霜遍地。南北奔赴秋天的节奏各不相同，北方秋叶纷纷，江南秋意渐深，而岭南</span><span>昼夜温差还在慢慢拉大。</span><span>“最近，白日依旧暖阳融融，早晚清风添了几分清冽，褪去盛夏黏腻的湿热，是一年里体感格外舒服的一段时光。”林学与风景园林学院教授吴永彬分享。</span></p><section><section><p><span>与此同时，美丽异木棉、</span><span>三角梅</span><span>等花木应时绽放</span><span>。今年，华农牌坊门附近的美丽</span><span>异木棉开得尤其好，</span><span>如云似霞，仿若春景。吴永彬介绍，</span><span>美丽异木棉</span><span>也叫美人树，在第四教学楼、启林南学生社区、林学与风景园林学院等均有种植。风过之时，粉白花瓣簌簌飘落，散落在走廊、石阶与校道之上，与往来师生共同构成一幅校园浪漫秋景。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBibic2gV6JoSgx8xWnIiaW7VjGGAh4ubYpicYgCm3kD1244l4mXylasghfiaHwtwXlXNBFIbVxrZf4cfu2iaxrXYa70vd6RJ204TRGs/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCARzg7UgYfxXibd5jGnwqOBBeEH26E4rHZtOZg4sQ8SnibR2l8QkWlhgANiaxibvlq295jkVoyhNMRZ5NOunPia3uDuZUZFkHmzNhc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCYKIqVibLFHFljog8WKwzUPd8TzUApTUiadqtfZb1XKGibySWIfsYXHtM6tKpjK9m3A0SOAIJvNCkia1rZthCx4H84dypOia4Jic9h4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckC1Unz5ION3za9NSmxcRQicrNUQH0qkhI7vGyZ4dzJMe2dlxLK8RALbUpDiabPTuG41mic3lePeP05CzqMdNckO519U7vcsrdZKts/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckA5GafzYFO2hVp56Yib8pKhMhSxJFiadladZ2G4rXznFQWqk1LbM8nt0o6SicyGrtYo9EFSziaanRxqzE9hTicFic5oQFgrVFx7SM8TQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>作为春秋盛开的“双季”选手，三角梅也是秋季繁花的重要成员。无论是三角市湖边的繁花艳艳，或是农林讲习所门楼旁的端雅舒展，都是此刻赏花的好去处。</span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDzPvN06AZudjiapXDOZSp8HvoHRvuU3KkCQdnSbI5GmgHsvtTCaiaHXJ3w0XXQJ8eiaUX2Jic6IVfRdB34OQ2pP3zsibVcXciaNQ4nQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckA7L4nRCWtGrjbs8MM5M9OctWEHx14ice0lvusfZqIoXGwESv71cfORzavXzvNW6eTRs7edKrjyGajmju8RrF4AK85p6aZiaRQ8U/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDZZeWYogTkibbZkbyAM2ZaBUGTHr3dJFJEKVo0Bjicd6iaNjFiaqgoO2lDPkGBrB2bFC9P1dYD0ibC9UhWzwwSMD9kaPUOUSyVKibDQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBX2CQziaWgc7D5CRMicPicxUjUgZyARpuhK3vwbzfDicsqTNpGuJ7QfDdHKjEYibrnTrec7UuCjGjSZRsSGLIRBd1y4UDrc7ibzw70k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCYia5PHMyBdkdtS8AFl7E6omnQJw18zdYp1NreEtYyzOBJSnV1SHf8Q66B1FuNMQKL0u5tbDQxYibxO7FMZHNOibicmwM5oTmCJbM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>动物科学学院及兽医学院院楼旁，几株樱花正悄悄绽放，上演着一场“春樱秋开”的奇妙景致。吴永彬解释：<span>“冷热交织、时序错位，连日偏高的气温搭配突如其来的降温，便把樱花‘骗’入了花期。”</span></span></p><p><span>他介绍，樱花能否开花、花量多少，除了依靠树体自身营养与激素积累，温度、光照也是重要的调控条件，而广州秋冬时节先降温再回暖的天气，容易让花芽误判时节。同时，樱花品类丰富，部分冬樱品种本就适合秋冬绽放，这背后，正是树木育种学独有的魅力，<span>“正是无数育种工作者的持续选育创新，才让我们的‘花花世界’有了这般丰富惊喜。”</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDpFrdZeWaDaF4iclHsyWiaQ1uDIdWqfoxcArEBSgicyJEUYYdonVezIA2iahiaVUTQFXQwwumpRgzvtS90Lo8eMNbHyx2FrbV3EsRM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>黄钟花</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDIkX0fZXQGCB2gicMlHkHFm6NXAr0Tfdctk4X1NgoGxcibs6LiaZ5RIvzDKYteuIYwURCficOZCv08bconHiaohLwREqqxummPPQQc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDQQvsibzzGdVMhj6jsozVuzPDtBRzcllOMZyZMkRflMTrjicUQVXt2hf2370kkC0ZM9BsJ1tTDIYD6kVDfelskPIkohaMcI0yJc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCoUdV6jibXB9DXal6OCQlWLzFltpP5uSEBPMrnMOFSkUZsJQjWYRxgibyY3B2YlnexOYfuibZw835KrrwzmRXQ8SAlfFp9DoIzNo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>铁刀木</span></p></section><p><span>启林北学生社区，自带“反差感”的铁刀木枝头，金黄色的花朵正在盛放。</span><span>铁刀木的枝干</span><span>坚韧强健，</span><span>一片片青嫩小叶轻盈舒展，</span><span>而花朵则小而密，给人以刚柔并济之感，别有一番风景。</span></p><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckArneiaHXTEptnlqJDeCafC8IxWPWuw9aHT2icbMsV4IRC7jCpdNPO8P8OULPDWueXyyWbLn6ovVJVPicyI2icyTpibeSvK7NBI9g7k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>睡莲“万维莎”</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAgUpFjjP7keoibAS8GXtfGlSI3OVnKHHkFR41V0fGteETliajTyPPmvjQopeK1gNWicHJH2yjchYVqpsuGsmvgt7C9ibqzia5EgIpU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>金银莲花</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCmRp0uHTGOTE2ibsj6eYBibtqibEH2CkQD4rvw84dN0tZN1c1zVMqw1mPiarRF2gsezPbbQLCwyNQ25ghWPr355FSVJAWSfa5zWsg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDAHZQDNaR9912SeB9166bcOkuOD9pf5USjM7jovSMd8aLsOMEjN4cNB9L1UHgVJXWhY41n1GiaJvEd8PoicSVlLQgpSkqBU3q1M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDE5KLfPQubAoulH9SMSMdHXnFdE9f3AM98YO8FtQCRgGyGme3aOUmJ2YXiaafYCibRhyibItA1JLkD8Cw8D0EMxicubde3NyqsOGw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>非洲菊</span></span></section></section><p><span>湿地公园的鄱阳湖水面，花瓣色彩和纹路神似“苹果切片”的睡莲“万维莎”再次盛开，而外形独特的金银莲花也悄然绽放，雪白色的流苏花瓣浮于碧色莲叶之间，清灵雅致。</span></p><p><span>自古以来，秋日便是赏菊登高的好季节。试验花圃间，非洲菊热烈盛放，橙黄花瓣层层舒展，满目绚烂。</span></p><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0ENyNdicZelDnuZ7TqfibeiaicvALw2ibv1ic2vFERBkulibZefpB1r6scUxamyJ59ggUTNP6IbMcolac50A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>草木循节令，风物见秋意</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0ENyNdicZelDnuZ7TqfibeiaicvZh2BnIdJJDTmibsqCv6UvzxrFriaNDPe12OKcicup2XGicVK3kucOricx4A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>霜降分三候，一候豺乃祭兽，意为山野生灵抓紧储备过冬食粮，顺应时节积蓄能量；二候草木黄落，意为</span><span>草木被秋霜打过后逐渐变黄，树叶开始大量凋零</span><span>；三候蛰虫咸俯，意为小虫慢慢藏入土中，安静蛰伏，静待来春。</span></p><p><span>在岭南，不少常绿树木慢慢褪去浓绿，花果走向成熟。</span><span>华农三角市的柿子树上，橙红果实正诉说着秋收的喜悦。</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckC2GMswrJFibIEAwUbZK89L2cyicFS5HC1bbuYFnicwxzib920xLwhzV2eqC2sjQeKVg0KM9RIAzZIJ9uRnxB5kl4qXTHck91xRpXc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDibGvz7KAJfQ5UCLWXJ5CBXaibPuXB4R03DP75F7pC5ibqwCCX9Dib8ibO04dWE9e6Z2iafwmGkCI9dFGhOWleLtqf1dNQUsP5eDibYM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDjibob7fLXJPAgnnkiaJmLxFG6md0YicBq6S9ztMJPg7oWN1tzA2JujOXsbNOibfOeqicgibIcoyYZPe2qEwCp5FxCpqGg8mWConb10/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>此时季节，正是老广讲究清润补水之时。雪梨、玉竹、百合、马蹄都是时令食材，</span><span>不厚不腻、温润滋补，</span><span>舒缓秋燥。旧时部分乡间还有祭霜降的乡土习俗，藏着当地人祈愿平安、感念收成的心意。一果一汤、一收一赏，都是岭南人顺着时节生活的智慧。</span></p><p><span>秋将落幕，万物收实</span></p><p><span>在清朗秋风里</span></p><p><span>收获春夏耕耘的果实</span></p><p><span>也静静等候冬日的到来</span></p><p><span>祝你不负好时光</span></p><p><span>岁岁丰收，万事顺遂</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCFOOfIjrfQsT0rncTCzmgBAiceU9TwHtz0lV3nYU4nqSwHymIAmdnW5ibJAEjEZ5bKy167AW5V8cOQfgm6tgkGHEnMDv6xZ4zRs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652898617&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=9cfa19a1bc135fa03bcb059c1a03f263&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCe2QVcUjZLWlwV0KkK6duziaicPVgvU2xwRh5srrXaiboRG5Hw8QEMxicxIpa3lZVjo3vGTbUnymGVvJtY9hVicviaYwNXdDicALiaKGI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span><span>小长假走了，“国庆花”还在 | 今日寒露</span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652900068&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b1c62ec6e3b9b100cd5e3e5c59e99f10&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBr7lJoDE50gzbXDEuk6H3HicvOkQ5wjd5bQ5z8A2ZbPfHCcVjm7Zz9g1AhoeWMIxCjSzDnz7QdrmP7dicIiaN2Pu0U78s3kUgPsU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span><span>明天开幕，华农等你！</span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652899813&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=de9311a8e55b7df2f1970ae8ff64a16e&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCb5Wia8DIcJ4sT0uspkFnof0tc4NWdCRITwqGg7pM0eicpqV7H6xd5lc4fajlKZVTOp2vhzveU10KTjibq6J2wuoECdzvmCS84nQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span><span>华农人扎根的第五年，这个绝美小镇怎样了？</span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAszSibZfA0CHgPM3kzialrSj5WCojtF0W3ZqbJ2WQG53kianxzAb1usC75iapbTmWQmJlVCic3pQ7O3USqJpw2IwDQsg5gJuLS3Sng/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>SCAU·栏目推荐</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDlw0jGdR49SXK5eEdFbaWBIPCibbDKBseP61tWKjrsxVf8vVFJLEPNC7ZtraxtRTEmFVeOibwPKbEiaUZY05aBZWxVhLKUcAMpiaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2195323138559836160&amp;subscene=159&amp;subscene=&amp;scenenote=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2F3O_0YYik0oCH8So067h1VA&amp;mid=2652893092&amp;idx=1&amp;nolastread=1&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2195323138559836160&amp;subscene=159&amp;subscene=&amp;scenenote=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2F3O_0YYik0oCH8So067h1VA&amp;mid=2652893092&amp;idx=1&amp;nolastread=1&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.co